 "sample_paragraphs": [
  "A component is a piece of UI that has its own logic and appearance.",
  "Components can be as small as a button, or as large as an entire page.",
  "You can nest components inside other components.",
  "When the state changes, the framework re-renders the component.",
  "During hydration, the client attaches event handlers to the HTML sent by the server.",
  "Props are read-only snapshots: every render receives a new version of props."
 ],
